    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713640/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1670245223\" /></div><br><br>The night is young and the time to steal is now! Follow the raccoon, Bop, on his midnight escapade through this retro, vaporwave inspired mall as he maneuvers his way through various store rooms, stealing everything not nailed down, before slinking away through the vents onto the next, bigger, and better thing.<br>Beware! This heist is not without peril! The mall has been equipped with a security system to deter pesky thieves who would steal the store wares and Bop will need your help. Spotlights shine, blink, and rove through the stores, searching to light up the raccoon of the hour and stopping him from stealing all of the items in the room. <br><br>If you think you are up to the task at hand, join this raccoon on his quest to ransack the mall in our 2D  top-down action-stealth game. Be quick, be clever, and most importantly, don\u2019t get caught!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713640/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1670245223\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Maneuver through beautiful 2D, hand designed levels<br></li><li>Steal items from 3 different types of stores<br></li><li>Avoid static, blinking, and roaming spotlights!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1713640/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1670245223\" /></div><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.",
